(7403078, 1165317, 29011, '<td valign="top">Knew this one was a winner. It''s a classic shot. I keep saying this in my comments but it doesn''t dilute the fact that this "will make a beautiful print!" . Glad to share the front page with you Cpt.</td>', 'Knew this one was a winner. It''s a classic shot. I keep saying this in my comments but it doesn''t dilute the fact that this "will make a beautiful print!" . Glad to share the front page with you Cpt.', '2015-09-07 11:12:19.000000', NULL, 0),
