(7403082, 1165306, 29011, '<td valign="top">A creative capture and artful image. I like to ponder the behind the scenes setup. My first guess is, the model is in a body of water and the scene photographed from above. But I''m only 75% sure of that guess ;)</td>', 'A creative capture and artful image. I like to ponder the behind the scenes setup. My first guess is, the model is in a body of water and the scene photographed from above. But I''m only 75% sure of that guess ;)', '2015-09-07 11:19:23.000000', NULL, 0),
