(7403091, 1165391, 128323, '<td valign="top">Soooo close to an HM!  Another outstanding entry during this DPL, Jake.  Congrats on the TT, and thanks for being one hell of a team leader during this tournament!  I look forward to playing with you on the next one, dude.</td>', 'Soooo close to an HM!  Another outstanding entry during this DPL, Jake.  Congrats on the TT, and thanks for being one hell of a team leader during this tournament!  I look forward to playing with you on the next one, dude.', '2015-09-07 11:48:48.000000', NULL, 0),
