(7403093, 1165340, 128323, '<td valign="top">I really thought I''d see this one on the front page.  Great shot Mark, after admiring your work from afar for the past several years, it''s been a real pleasure getting to play alongside you during this DPL.</td>', 'I really thought I''d see this one on the front page.  Great shot Mark, after admiring your work from afar for the past several years, it''s been a real pleasure getting to play alongside you during this DPL.', '2015-09-07 11:51:37.000000', NULL, 0),
