(7403105, 1165496, 109227, '<td valign="top">So nicely done Wendy.  I am a sucker for a nicely done still life.  It is cathartic working on a still life image; your mind gets immersed into the fine details, light, storytelling, control, etc.  This is more so than other genres I think; pity we don''t do more of it.</td>', 'So nicely done Wendy.  I am a sucker for a nicely done still life.  It is cathartic working on a still life image; your mind gets immersed into the fine details, light, storytelling, control, etc.  This is more so than other genres I think; pity we don''t do more of it.', '2015-09-07 12:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7403116, 1165391, 115814, '<td valign="top">I''m usually disdainful of IR photos. Most often I find them to be gimmicky and seldom see added interest/value as a result of the technique. This is different. This is stunning. If I''d been here in time to award my humble bling before rollover, I''d have left you one of these...;.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1153350" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/115000-119999/115814/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1153350.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I''m usually disdainful of IR photos. Most often I find them to be gimmicky and seldom see added interest/value as a result of the technique. This is different. This is stunning. If I''d been here in time to award my humble bling before rollover, I''d have left you one of these...;. ', '2015-09-07 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
