(7403140, 1165317, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by vawendy:</b></div><hr/><i> Where the heck is this?!? It''s awesome!! Huge congrats on the win, but I take it back if you don''t give us some info on the great find. :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is Dungeness south coast east side UK. I had to drive to Folkestone to drop off a camera I had sold and thought it may be worth the small trip down to Dungeness for a shot. So glad I did.</td>', 'Originally posted by vawendy: Where the heck is this?!? It''s awesome!! Huge congrats on the win, but I take it back if you don''t give us some info on the great find. :)   This is Dungeness south coast east side UK. I had to drive to Folkestone to drop off a camera I had sold and thought it may be worth the small trip down to Dungeness for a shot. So glad I did.', '2015-09-07 12:53:30.000000', NULL, 0),
