(7403575, 1165240, 115664, '<td valign="top">Pretzel, we were there 3 and a half days. This happened the morning of the second full day. Most of the time the Jaguars are viewed just lying around sleeping for hours, the most activity seen is of them getting up and walking off into the jungle. To see this was truly amazing from all points of view! :-)</td>', 'Pretzel, we were there 3 and a half days. This happened the morning of the second full day. Most of the time the Jaguars are viewed just lying around sleeping for hours, the most activity seen is of them getting up and walking off into the jungle. To see this was truly amazing from all points of view! :-)', '2015-09-08 14:10:09.000000', NULL, 0),
